+<a id="agentmax-tokens-retry--log-only"></a>
+
+#### `agent/max-tokens-retry` — log-only
+
+```ts persistence-catalog
+/**
+ * One regeneration of a step whose response stopped at the output-token
+ * ceiling, under agent-loop `maxTokensRetries`. The cut response is the
+ * preceding `assistant/attempt` of the same step, never model-visible;
+ * the step's request is rebuilt from unchanged history.
+ */
+'agent/max-tokens-retry': {
+  turn: number
+  step: number
+  /** 1-based retry number within the step. */
+  retry: number
+  /** The configured `maxTokensRetries`. */
+  maxRetries: number
+  /** Output tokens the cut response reported, when its stream carried usage. */
+  outputTokens?: number
+}
+```
+
+Source: [`packages/core/agent/src/types.ts:100`](../packages/core/agent/src/types.ts)
